# Archived/showcase assets (moved out of git)
docs/archive/
docs/showcase/

# Strike-MCP staged Bubble → Supabase migrations
# SQL bodies contain PII (names, emails, salary) and can be 10MB+ per tenant.
# Manifests + reports are small, PII-free, and form the audit trail (see Learning 0033).
supabase/bubble-data/**/*.sql
!supabase/bubble-data/**/MANIFEST.json
!supabase/bubble-data/**/*.report.md
